  <compounddef id="Resizable-example" kind="example">
    <compoundname>Resizable</compoundname>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Create a heap-allocated pool with owned arena. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Create a heap-allocated pool with owned arena<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>block_size</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Size of each block in bytes </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>blocks_per_chunk</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of blocks to allocate per growth </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>alignment</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Block alignment (0 = default, must be power of 2) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>arena_initial_bytes</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Initial arena size </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>grow_enabled</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>If true, pool can grow dynamically </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>prewarm</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>If true, allocate first chunk immediately</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Expected containing UniquePtr to pool on success, or error</para>
</simplesect>
Creates a pool that owns its own dynamic arena. The pool can optionally grow by allocating additional chunks as needed.</para>
<para>If prewarm=true, allocates the first chunk immediately so the first allocation is guaranteed O(1). If prewarm=false and grow_enabled=false, the pool will be unusable.</para>
<para>pool <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">auto<sp/>pool<sp/>=<sp/>cslt::move(cslt::PoolAllocator::Heap(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>256,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>256-byte<sp/>blocks</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>64,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>64<sp/>blocks<sp/>per<sp/>chunk</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>default<sp/>alignment</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>16384,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>16KB<sp/>initial<sp/>arena</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>true,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>can<sp/>grow</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>true<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>prewarm</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">).value());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">//<sp/>Can<sp/>allocate<sp/>indefinitely<sp/>-<sp/>pool<sp/>grows<sp/>as<sp/>needed</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">for<sp/>(int<sp/>i<sp/>=<sp/>0;<sp/>i<sp/>&lt;<sp/>1000;<sp/>++i)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>auto<sp/>ptr<sp/>=<sp/>pool-&gt;alloc(256);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> <programlisting filename="Resizable"></programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
